id: og_blockhouse_c
name: Blockhouse III
description: Blockhouse. Everything you can see is a wall with a slit in it, everything that matters is underneath, and the way between them is a door built to be shut. Built as a hardened command post; the site was decommissioned and the blast door was jacked open for the scrap men.

